# Restart a growth frame of the published 4096-molecule mW trajectory
# and equilibrate the new velocities.
# Ensemble of that run: NPT, 1 atm, 208 K
# (Goswami, Goswami and Singh, J. Chem. Inf. Model. 60, 2169 (2020)).
# The integrator step is 10 fs. The Nose-Hoover temperature damping
# is 1 ps and the pressure damping is 5 ps, the mW constants of
# Moore and Molinero, Nature 479, 506 (2011). The published frames
# are isotropic, so the barostat is iso.
# pair_style sw reads mW.sw: epsilon 6.189 kcal/mol, sigma 2.3925 A,
# lambda 23.15 (Molinero and Moore, J. Phys. Chem. B 113, 4008 (2009)).

variable step index 15780000
variable nequil index 2000
variable seed index 15780000

units real
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
atom_modify map array

region box block 0 1 0 1 0 1
create_box 1 box
read_dump start.lammpstrj ${step} x y z box yes add yes

mass 1 18.015
pair_style sw
pair_coeff * * mW.sw mW
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes

timestep 10.0
velocity all create 208.0 ${seed} mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix bath all npt temp 208.0 208.0 1000.0 iso 1.0 1.0 5000.0
thermo 500
thermo_style custom step temp pe press density

run ${nequil}
write_restart equil.restart
write_dump all custom equil.lammpstrj id type x y z modify sort id
